406
40:29.742 --> 40:31.946
It's on me.

407
40:32.425 --> 40:33.376
Thank you.

408
40:34.073 --> 40:35.417
Bye!

409
40:38.652 --> 40:40.235
If you harass another customer like that,

410
40:40.259 --> 40:41.465
I’ll report you to Cherd next time.

411
40:44.816 --> 40:45.496
Why?

412
40:48.965 --> 40:50.421
You're working here.

413
40:51.104 --> 40:52.646
That means you're no different from me.

414
40:53.628 --> 40:55.428
Don’t act so high and mighty.

415
40:56.288 --> 40:57.581
It pisses me off.

416
40:59.327 --> 41:00.569
Let me tell you something.

417
41:00.983 --> 41:02.917
All this place cares about is the rules

418
41:03.998 --> 41:05.314
and I haven’t broken any.

419
41:15.393 --> 41:16.777
Would you like me to heat up

420
41:16.801 --> 41:18.109
the chocolate lava cake, beautiful?

421
41:20.593 --> 41:21.466
Get to work.

422
41:28.956 --> 41:30.120
Is it your birthday today?

423
41:31.604 --> 41:36.116
Happy birthday to you.

424
41:36.997 --> 41:37.645
Rule number seven.

425
41:37.917 --> 41:39.323
When heating food in the microwave,

426
41:39.526 --> 41:41.217
employees must not turn around to look at customers

427
41:41.241 --> 41:44.350
until the microwave beeps to signal that it’s done.

428
41:48.346 --> 41:52.413
Happy birthday to you.

429
41:52.737 --> 41:53.862
Anyone to celebrate with?

430
41:54.466 --> 41:56.643
You can invite me.

431
42:07.162 --> 42:07.795
Rule number two.

432
42:08.193 --> 42:09.142
Employees must never respond

433
42:09.166 --> 42:11.318
when a customer calls them by name.

434
42:13.658 --> 42:14.713
That’s cheating.

435
42:18.250 --> 42:20.501
Rules are rules.

436
42:52.588 --> 42:53.625
It's you.

437
43:53.150 --> 43:54.721
Thank you for shopping at Sunny Mart.

438
44:02.291 --> 44:03.643
Thank you for shopping at Sunny Mart.

439
44:28.313 --> 44:29.032
Because here...

440
44:30.130 --> 44:32.299
The rules are a matter of life and death.

441
44:55.443 --> 44:58.303
Could I get an advance for the next 10 days?

442
44:58.551 --> 44:59.863
Ten thousand baht is nothing.

443
45:00.368 --> 45:01.113
How’s that supposed to be enough?

444
45:01.395 --> 45:02.676
Nava!

445
45:02.701 --> 45:04.693
You need to get me a hundred thousand.

446
45:06.142 --> 45:08.884
And how can you be sure you’ll last the full ten days?

447
45:09.735 --> 45:11.908
So what exactly are those things?

448
45:12.895 --> 45:14.246
It doesn't matter what they are.

449
45:14.707 --> 45:15.613
One thing’s for sure.

450
45:15.947 --> 45:17.082
They can kill you.

451
45:18.040 --> 45:19.715
You know how dangerous this place is.

452
45:19.740 --> 45:20.556
So what?

453
45:20.743 --> 45:22.506
Do I have to follow you around every second?
